                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": ".@LeaderJohnThune leads Senate Republicans to deliver again! Here\u2019s what we accomplished after 24 hours voting on the Senate floor:\n\n\u2705 Stopped a $4 trillion tax hike, preventing a tax increase of more than $2,500 per SD family.\n\u2705 Strengthened Medicaid & Medicare by rooting out waste, fraud and abuse.\n\u2705 Secured our border.\n\u2705 Safeguarded national security by boosting military funding.\n\u2705 Supported SD nursing homes by eliminating burdensome Biden-era staffing mandates that threatened to close facilities.",
